WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.777
What was the best part? Let the whole Popkin say.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.091
Experiences collects what the group did, and what it wants to do next.

00:00:12.291 --> 00:00:16.765
Every card has its picture, its kind, who shared it and when, and its score.

00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:19.500
Filter by All, We did, or Want to do.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.092
Choose Share one. Share an experience asks for a title and a kind: Something we did,

00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:28.968
Restaurant, or Want to do.

00:00:29.168 --> 00:00:32.604
When, a place and a picture are optional. Then choose Share it.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.493
The dialog closes, your experience is first in the list, and a toast says:

00:00:38.493 --> 00:00:39.886
Experience shared.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.118
Open an experience, and it has a page of its own.

00:00:45.318 --> 00:00:49.933
The group's score is four point seven, from eleven ratings, with a bar for each

00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:50.525
star.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.179
How was it for you? Choose a star, from one to five.

00:00:55.379 --> 00:00:59.988
Thanks! Your rating. The score moves to four point eight, from twelve ratings.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.617
Add a comment opens a dialog with your stars, and a field named Your comment.

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:10.736
Choose Post comment, and your words are first under What people said.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.775
What you shared is yours to change. Experience actions, over the picture, offers

00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:18.030
Edit and Delete.

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:21.157
Edit opens Edit experience, with what it has.

00:01:21.357 --> 00:01:26.360
Delete asks first: Delete this experience? Its ratings and comments go with it.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.604
On the Popkin home, Experiences shows the highest rated, with its score.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.282
On a phone, the cards are one across.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.672
On a tablet, two. From ten twenty-four pixels, three. From twelve eighty, four

00:01:43.672 --> 00:01:44.391
across.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.510
And from ten twenty-four, an experience has its picture beside its ratings.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.804
What no screen shows: each member has one rating. Choose a different star and it

00:01:56.804 --> 00:01:59.506
changes, while the count stays the same.

00:01:59.706 --> 00:02:01.986
Still to come: saying you are keen.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.518
That is journey eight. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
